        <h3>OCD &amp; Intrusive Thought Recovery</h3>
        <p>Breaks checking, washing, contamination &amp; mental rituals using gentle <strong>ICBT + CBT + ACT</strong> (without forcing overwhelming ERP exposures).</p>
        <div class="prog-tags">
          <span class="prog-tag">ICBT Doubt Reset</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Gradual ERP</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Relapse Prevention</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://tealfeed.com/care_891921/connect/call?callType=6a33e7d7be9e52a1656f9244" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prog-book-btn">
          <span>Book OCD Call (TealFeed) →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 2: Waswasa -->
    <div class="prog-panel" id="prog-waswasa">
      <div class="prog-svg-box">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="20" fill="#ECFDF5" stroke="#0F766E" stroke-width="2.8"/><path d="M32 40L37 45L49 33" stroke="#0F766E" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 44C16 56 26 65 40 68C54 65 64 56 64 44" stroke="#6B1D35" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </div>
