        <h3>Structured Religious OCD (Waswasa — 2 Months)</h3>
        <p>Faith-sensitive 8-session program for Wudu/Taharah doubts, repeating Salah, &amp; unwanted Kufr/Shirk thoughts with custom audio support.</p>
        <div class="prog-tags">
          <span class="prog-tag">Faith-Sensitive</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">8-Session Roadmap</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Custom Audio Guides</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://tealfeed.com/care_891921/connect/package?packageId=6a33e7cf1e9ad26920c0e452" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prog-book-btn">
          <span>Book Waswasa Package (TealFeed) →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 3: Panic & Anxiety -->
    <div class="prog-panel" id="prog-anxiety">
      <div class="prog-svg-box">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="26" stroke="#6B1D35" stroke-width="2.8"/><path d="M20 40H30L35 26L43 54L49 35L53 40H60" stroke="#0F766E" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
