        <p>Stops racing heart, health paranoia, chronic overthinking, and emotional burnout using structured <strong>CBT, REBT &amp; SFBT</strong>.</p>
        <div class="prog-tags">
          <span class="prog-tag">Panic Reset</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Overthinking Control</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Sleep &amp; Focus</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.tealfeed.com/care_891921/connect/call?callType=6a4ce48f19832a00610cb914" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prog-book-btn">
          <span>Book Anxiety Call (TealFeed) →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

