        <h3>Marriage &amp; Couple Counseling</h3>
        <p>Joint + individual partner sessions to resolve recurring conflicts, trust issues, emotional distance, and communication breakdowns.</p>
        <div class="prog-tags">
          <span class="prog-tag">Joint + 1-on-1</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Conflict Resolution</span>
          <span class="prog-tag">Trust Rebuilding</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://tealfeed.com/care_891921/connect/call?callType=6a33e7dc1e9ad26920c0e475" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prog-book-btn">
          <span>Book Couples Call (TealFeed) →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compact Specialist Card: Aftab Siddiqui -->
    <div class="specialist-compact">
      <div class="spec-top">
        <img src="assets/aftab-portrait.jpg" alt="Aftab Siddiqui — OCD & Anxiety Specialist" class="spec-img" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <span class="spec-badge">★ Lead Specialist</span>
          <h3 class="spec-name">Aftab Siddiqui</h3>
          <div class="spec-role">OCD, Waswasa &amp; Anxiety Counselor</div>
          <div class="spec-pills">
            <span>CBT</span><span>ICBT</span><span>ERP</span><span>ACT</span><span>REBT</span><span>DBT</span><span>NLP</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-points">
        <div class="spec-pt">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span>Retrains the root subconscious loop — no surface “stay positive” clichés</span>
